<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome — COD King partner program</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f1f5f9;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrap {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 20px 48px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding: 28px 24px 32px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .lead {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: #475569;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
    }
    p, li {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: #334155;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }
    ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .section-title {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #64748b;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin: 24px 0 10px;
    }
    .code-block {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      margin: 12px 0 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .code-label {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .code-value {
      font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", "SF Mono", Menlo, Monaco, monospace;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0f172a;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }
    .muted {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .btn-wrap {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 28px 0 8px;
    }
    a.button {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      background: #1e293b;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    a.text-link {
      color: #2563eb;
      word-break: break-all;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }
    .footer {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin-top: 24px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: #e2e8f0;
      margin: 22px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Welcome to the COD King partner program</h1>
      <p class="lead">Hi <%= @name %>, your partner account is ready. Use the steps below to attach stores you manage and log in to your dashboard.</p>

      <p class="section-title">Link a Shopify store to your referrals</p>
      <p>For each store that should count toward your referrals, open the <strong>COD King</strong> app in that store&rsquo;s admin, go to <strong>Billing</strong>, and enter your referral code. The store will be connected to your partner account.</p>

      <% if @referral_code.present? %>
        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-label">Your referral code</div>
          <div class="code-value"><%= @referral_code %></div>
        </div>
      <% end %>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <p class="section-title">Partner dashboard</p>
      <p>Sign in to track referred shops, earnings, and payouts.</p>
      <div class="btn-wrap">
        <a class="button" href="<%= @login_url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open partner login</a>
      </div>
      <p class="muted" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0;">
        Or copy this link:<br>
        <a class="text-link" href="<%= @login_url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><%= @login_url %></a>
      </p>

      <% if @password.present? %>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p class="section-title">Sign-in email</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong><%= @email %></strong></p>
        <p class="section-title" style="margin-top: 16px;">Temporary password</p>
        <p class="muted">Please change this after you first sign in.</p>
        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-value" style="font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0;"><%= @password %></div>
        </div>
      <% end %>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <p class="section-title">Your starting commission rates</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Subscription revenue:</strong> <%= ("%g" % @partner.subscription_commission_rate.to_f) %>%</li>
        <li><strong>Usage-based charges:</strong> <%= ("%g" % @partner.usage_commission_rate.to_f) %>%</li>
        <li><strong>One-time charges:</strong> <%= ("%g" % @partner.onetime_commission_rate.to_f) %>%</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="muted">When your referral amount crosses <strong>$100 per month</strong>, revised subscription rates may apply for that tier. We&rsquo;ll align changes with your account activity.</p>

      <p class="section-title">What you can do in the dashboard</p>
      <ul>
        <li>View shops linked to your referral code</li>
        <li>Track accrued commissions and payout history</li>
        <li>Download reports for your records</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="footer">
        Questions? Reply to this email or contact COD King support.<br><br>
        This message includes sign-in details. Please keep it confidential.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
